t":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-11-16T08:13:20Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:14:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### やりたいこと\n\nsrc/strings.js に wrapC(s, width) を足したい。文字列を、幅 width 以下の行に折り返す\n\n### 完了条件\n\nwrapC(\"the quick brown fox\", 10) は \"the quick\\nbrown fox\" を返す（空白の位置で折り返し、行の区切りは \\n）\nwrapC(\"a b c\", 1) は \"a\\nb\\nc\" を返す\nwrapC(\"abcdefghij\", 4) は \"abcd\\nefgh\\nij\" を返す（width より長い語は width ごとに切る）\nwrapC(\"a   b\", 10) は \"a b\" を返す（続く空白は1つにまとめる）\nwrapC(\"  a  \", 10) は \"a\" を返す（前後の空白は除く）\nwrapC(\"\", 5) は \"\" を返す\nwidth が 1 より小さいか整数でないとき（0、-1、1.5、NaN）は RangeError を投げる\n新しいテストのファイルに node:test のテストがあり、npm test で既存のテストも含めて全部通る\n\n### 今回やらないこと\n\n既存の関数の変更、既存のテストのファイルの変更、全角文字の幅の扱い、s が文字列以外のときの扱い","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shumatsumonobu/merge-while-you-sleep-trial/issues/23/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shumatsumonobu/merge-while-you-sleep-trial/issues/23/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}